  "description": "For generations, the power of the Imugi has been passed down to the nation’s sacred Oracle—a divine protector of peace and balance. But for the young Oracle Ho-Yeong, that power remains dormant. Cast aside as a failure within the palace, he finds solace only in Chi Woo, the noble heir of the prestigious House of Chi. One night, Ho-Yeong stumbles upon Chi Woo in a forbidden tryst—and with it, awakens a feeling he's never known. As secrets unfurl behind silk screens and sacred duty collides with dangerous desire, Ho-Yeong's path as the Oracle may lead to more than just prophecy… it may unearth a destiny no one saw coming.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
